/1283839-water-bears-riding-bugs-and-forge-goddesses-new-hundred-devils?p=1283876#post1283876\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My only complaint--except for yeah, Forest Strider's page order--is no notes on familiar dots. I'm guessing 2 dots each? Neither appear godblooded or legendary size or the like.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, 2 dots seems right. They are formidable and useful beasts \u2014 riding animals and vicious predators \u2014 but not overly exceptional and not magical.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-31T06:11:21-08:00","id":1283901,"title":"","content":"The notion of Icewalkers with armoured bears pleases me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-31T06:33:31-08:00","id":1283908,"title":"","content":"Makelo's dice adder would also be interesting for a Crafting-based Exigent.<br /> <br /> I think the two animals are quite evocative for certain regions; if you are doing a game in the Far Ea